<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - EVEREN raises Invacare.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - EVEREN raises Invacare.</headline>
<text>
<p>- EVEREN Securities said it raised its rating on Invacare Corp to outperform from market perform.</p>
<p>- EVEREN cited what it believes is an overreaction in share price to a modest slowing in the earnings growth rate and to recent disappointing earnings previews by several home health care providers.</p>
<p>- Shares of Invacare were up 5/8 to 27-3/8. The stock fell 1/2 on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Chicago Newsdesk 312 408 8787</p>
</text>
